	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "AC0p6zhHQcvuS92iy",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 20, DX 10, IQ 1, HT 14, HP 20, WILL 7, PER 10, FP 14, SPEED 5, MOVE 1, DODGE 8, DR 5. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "Aya2z5Ps8MI6bZ8PD",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 45 (offense 19, protection 26), threat tier standard, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "AWewhVJ337xAD2crs",
			"text": "Entangle (Binding 10) (Binding ST 10), reach 8-yard emanation: No attack roll and no active defense. No attack roll. Emanation covering an 8-yard radius, usable only where the area holds dense vegetation. Victims caught in the area are bound at effective ST 10 and stay bound for roughly 100 seconds; escape is a Quick Contest against the Binding's ST. Persistent, so the binding is not consumed by one escape."
		},
		{
			"id": "AXez10p0vpxWiuirh",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/assassin-vine.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "AAGe-JJV05rhVIswq",
			"text": "Source template total: 92 points."
		},
